T1  - BADS: A backdoor attack against code intent summarization engines
AU  - Qu, Yubin
AU  - Li, Binyong
AU  - Huang, Song
AU  - Nie, Peng
AU  - Li, Long
AU  - Yao, Yongming
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 192
